<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\山の中.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\墓地昼.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"Please... rest in peace..."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\砂利を歩く.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "500" "0"}
{CHGVOL "VOICE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "500" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE>Mifuyu-san<STYLE ID="1">, so this is where you were."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="1">Mother</STYLE>..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Eiichiro</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s memorial service is over, and you still haven't prayed enough?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"No... I have one more family member, you see..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Ah, that's right."</STYLE><PG>
"I have never forgotten 'Ayaka' for even a single day."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Ayaka...? Was that her name?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"No, it's a name I gave her afterward. She appeared in my dream the other day..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"A dream... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
Mifuyu-san<STYLE ID="1">, you've lost both </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Eiichiro</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and Ayaka, but I'm family to </STYLE>you<STYLE ID="1"> too. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Everyone in this settlement is on </STYLE>your<STYLE ID="1"> side."</STYLE><PG>
"Thank you. I'm all right now. 
{PAUSE ""}
Um, where's <STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE>...?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s looking after </STYLE><STYLE ID="4" RUBY="かな">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">. She's having her practice crawling."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I see... 
{PAUSE ""}
Come to think of it, I haven't seen <STYLE ID="5" RUBY="ちがや">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">-chan</STYLE> today?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5" RUBY="ちがや">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">She</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s in the hospital right now. It's nothing serious, so she'll be out next week."</STYLE><PG>
"Oh, that's the first I've heard of it... 
{PAUSE ""}
Um, about visiting <STYLE ID="5" RUBY="ちがや">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">-chan</STYLE> in the hospital―"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"It's nothing much, so don't worry about it. </STYLE>Mifuyu-san<STYLE ID="1">, this is a day trip for you, isn't it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yes, I have things to do once I get back to Megasawa."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE>Mifuyu-san<STYLE ID="1">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">what do you think of this settlement?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Huh?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Believe it or not, I'm trying to change this settlement, as its head."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Change it...?"<PG>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Erica.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">"As </STYLE>you<STYLE ID="1"> know, this settlement has a lot of secrets, and everyone is very wary of outsiders. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But those days have to come to an end now. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">In the past, they made strange drugs and committed murders, but I won't allow anything like that. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Even if you protect people by doing such things, that's nothing but self-righteous justice."</STYLE><PG>
"<STYLE ID="1">Mother</STYLE>... what if..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hm?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"What if I committed a murder, what would you do?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE>You<STYLE ID="1">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Just hypothetically."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Even if I hold up a policy like the one I just described, there's no knowing what's going on beneath the surface. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">If someone were about to make drugs or commit a murder where I couldn't see..."</STYLE><PG>
"I'm sorry, please forget what I said just now."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE>Mifuyu-san<STYLE ID="1">, if you're ever in trouble, you can just take </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and run here."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Huh?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"There's a </STYLE><STYLE ID="7" RUBY="おきて">rule</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> that children can't live here until they turn 16, but it doesn't suit the times anymore. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">If </STYLE>you<STYLE ID="1"> ever feel like doing something rash, come talk to me. In </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Eiichiro</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s place, I'll help you."</STYLE><PG>
"............"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Well, I'll head back to the house. Don't catch a cold."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\砂利を歩く.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "7000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"No...!
{PAUSE ""}
　<STYLE ID="1">Mother</STYLE>... 
{PAUSE ""}
it's already too late...!"
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
